[Desktop Entry]
Version=1.0
Type=Application
Name=Preferencias de KDE Plasma (KCM)
GenericName=Panel de Control KDE
Comment=Lanzador directo para módulos de configuración de KDE Plasma 6
Icon=preferences-system
Exec=kcmshell6 kcm_landingpage
Terminal=false
Categories=Settings;HardwareSettings;DesktopSettings;Qt;KDE;
StartupNotify=true
Actions=AboutDistro;Access;Activities;Animations;AppPermissions;AudioInfo;Autostart;BalooFile;BlockDevices;Bluetooth;Bolt;Cellular;Clock;Colors;ComponentChooser;CpuInfo;CursorTheme;DesktopPaths;DesktopTheme;DeviceAutomounter;Disks;Edid;EglInfo;EnergyInfo;Feedback;FileTypes;Firewall;FirmwareSecurity;FontInst;Fonts;GameController;GlxInfo;Icons;Interrupts;KAccounts;Kded;Keyboard;Keys;KrdpServer;KScreen;KWallet5;KWinEffects;KWinScripts;KWinVirtualDesktops;KWinDecoration;KWinOptions;KWinRules;KWinScreenEdges;KWinSupportInfo;KWinTabBox;KWinTouchscreen;KWinXwayland;LandingPage;LookAndFeel;MemoryInfo;MobileHotspot;MobilePower;MobileWifi;MobileWired;Mouse;NetPref;NetworkInfo;NetworkManagement;NightLight;NightTime;Notifications;OpenCLInfo;PciInfo;PlasmaKeyboard;PlasmaLogin;PlasmaSearch;PowerDevil;PrinterManager;Proxy;PulseAudio;QtQuickSettings;RecentFiles;RegionAndLang;Samba;ScreenLocker;Sensors;SmServer;SolidActions;SoundTheme;SplashScreen;Style;Tablet;Touchpad;Touchscreen;Updates;UsbDevices;Users;VirtualKeyboard;VulkanInfo;Wallpaper;WaylandInfo;WebShortcuts;Workspace;XServerInfo;SpellChecking;

